OL,3,CMan charged in connection with armed
OL,4,Crobbery in Carrickfergus
OL,6,FA 34-year-old man has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with an armed robbery at an
OL,8,Foff-licence in Carrickfergus on Friday.
OL,10,FHe is charged with robbery, assault on
OL,11,Fpolice, criminal damage, false
OL,12,Fimprisonment, threats to kill, common
OL,13,Fassault and aggravated burglary and
OL,14,Fstealing.
OL,16,FHe is due to appear at Belfast
OL,17,FMagistrates Court on Monday 3rd August.
OL,19,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,20,FITVX
